<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ro"><%- include("../fragmente/head", { titlu: "PC Forge - Recuperare parolă" }) %><body id="top"><%- include("../fragmente/header") %><main class="main-cont"><section class="cont-card"><span class="eyebrow">Etapa 8 · Bonus 4</span><h2>Recuperează parola</h2><p>Introdu adresa contului. Linkul primit este valabil 30 de minute.</p><form method="post" class="row g-3"><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="email-reset">E-mail</label><input class="form-control" id="email-reset" type="email" name="email" required /></div><div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Trimite linkul</button></div></form><% if (mesaj) { %><p class="alert alert-success mt-3"><%= mesaj %></p><% } %><% if (linkResetare) { %><p class="alert alert-info">Mod demonstrativ: <a href="<%= linkResetare %>">deschide linkul de resetare</a>.</p><% } %></section></main><%- include("../fragmente/footer") %></body></html>
